# Tests

Place unit tests here using PlatformIO's Unity test framework.

Structure:
  test/test_<name>/
    test_<name>.cpp

Run with:
  pio test -e native   (for host-based tests)
  pio test -e esp32doit-devkit-v1   (for on-device tests)

See: https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/
